# Stack

Не копировать технологии из `analytic` (GORM, golang-migrate, JWT/SSO).

| Задача | Технология |
|---|---|
| Backend | Go 1.27.x |
| HTTP | Echo v4 поверх `net/http` |
| DB | PostgreSQL + pgx v5 (pgxpool) |
| SQL | sqlc (`queries.sql` в infrastructure) |
| Migrations | Goose |
| Cache | Redis |
| Files | S3-compatible (модуль media) |
| API schema | OpenAPI |
| Async | worker + PostgreSQL Outbox |
| Observability | OpenTelemetry |
| Metrics | Prometheus |
| Logs | slog |

TX: `pgx.Tx` в context (`platform/transaction`), не GORM.

HTTP: Echo, не chi. OpenAPI собирается из delivery.

Front (другой репозиторий): TypeScript, React, Next.js, Telegram WebApp SDK.
